{"parse":{"title":"个性/逐光猎影","pageid":8868,"revid":21809,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%80%90%E5%85%89%E7%8C%8E%E5%BD%B1&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%80%90%E5%85%89%E7%8C%8E%E5%BD%B1&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%80%90%E5%85%89%E7%8C%8E%E5%BD%B1&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>逐光猎影</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.80.90.E5.85.89.E7.8C.8E.E5.BD.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"逐光猎影\"><b>逐光猎影</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 逐光猎影.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/euo5jklb0pjixmy1j0nflzq16nxwjn2.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%80%90%E5%85%89%E7%8C%8E%E5%BD%B1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/euo5jklb0pjixmy1j0nflzq16nxwjn2.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%80%90%E5%85%89%E7%8C%8E%E5%BD%B1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9a/euo5jklb0pjixmy1j0nflzq16nxwjn2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />逐光猎影\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">潜袭</font></span>]。主动攻击后可使用剩余移动力再移动。单体攻击前，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"重点标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">重点标记</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。主动攻击后，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼受治疗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼受护盾1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼受护盾1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：触发时获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伺机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">伺机</font></span></span>]。<br />✦主动非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击或击败目标时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伺机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">伺机</font></span></span>]；攻击后，若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]状态，自身额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伺机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">伺机</font></span></span>]，每回合最多触发1次。<br />✦每回合最多获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伺机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">伺机</font></span></span>]，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伺机回能1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">伺机回能1</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%A7%91%E5%B0%94%E2%80%A2%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BD%B1\" title=\"角色图鉴库/科尔•破晓之影\"><img alt=\"头像 科尔•破晓之影.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/37/s64mud9bi15h38c9dwqxym1is3qfo2p.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">科尔•破晓之影</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-b